Package: hplcAnalyzer
Type: Package
Title: Automated HPLC-UV Analysis and peptide concentration estimation
Version: 0.7.3
Author: Peter Kubiniok
Maintainer: Peter Kubiniok <peterkubiniok@quantivum.com>
Authors@R: 
    person("Peter", "Kubiniok", email = "peterkubiniok@quantivum.com",
           role = c("aut", "cre"))
Description: Read Agilent .D folders or thermo UV data exports (.txt), perform baseline correction if needed,
    detect peaks, compute concentrations, estimate peptide sequence-specific molar absorptivity at 214 nm (Kuipers & Gruppen, 2007,
    with the tryptophan term and a global scale recalibrated on measured 214/280 nm data) and at
    280 nm (Pace et al., 1995), and generate plot results.
License: GPL-3
Encoding: UTF-8
LazyData: true
